	</div>

<div id="" class="hds-card-grid padding-top-7 padding-bottom-3 padding-x-0 hds-color-mode-light color-mode-light hds-module hds-module-full alignfull wp-block-nasa-blocks-card-grid">			<div class="hds-card-grid-header grid-container grid-container-block">
				<div class="grid-row flex-align-start margin-bottom-5">
					<div class="desktop:grid-col-8 margin-bottom-2 desktop:margin-bottom-0">
						<div class="margin-bottom-1">
							<h2 class="section-heading-sm line-height-sm">Crewed Project Mercury Missions</h2>
						</div>
													<p class="margin-0 padding-0">From May 1961 to May 1963, NASA launched six astronauts into space as part of its first human spaceflight program.</p>
											</div>
					<div class="desktop:grid-col display-flex flex-align-center desktop:flex-justify-end">
											</div>
				</div>
				<div class="grid-row grid-gap-2"></div>
			</div>
			<div class="hds-card-grid-cards grid-container grid-container-block">
				<div class="hds-cards-included grid-row">
					<div class="hds-card-custom hds-card color-carbon-black display-flex flex-column margin-bottom-5 mobile:grid-col-12 tablet:grid-col-6 desktop:grid-col-4 margin-bottom-6"><div class="hds-card-inner"><div class="hds-card-thumbnail hds-card-hover-zoom-image margin-bottom-2 bg-carbon-black"><figure class="hds-media-background "><img decoding="async" width="809" height="1024" src="https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/535533main_Capsule_full.jpg?w=809" class="attachment-large size-large" alt="Shepard Approaches Freedom 7 Capsule" style="transform: scale(1.2); transform-origin: 48% 27%; object-position: 48% 27%; object-fit: cover;" block_context="nasa-block" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/535533main_Capsule_full.jpg 1041w, https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/535533main_Capsule_full.jpg?resize=237,300 237w, https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/535533main_Capsule_full.jpg?resize=768,972 768w, https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/535533main_Capsule_full.jpg?resize=809,1024 809w, https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/535533main_Capsule_full.jpg?resize=316,400 316w, https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/535533main_Capsule_full.jpg?resize=474,600 474w, https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/535533main_Capsule_full.jpg?resize=711,900 711w, https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/535533main_Capsule_full.jpg?resize=948,1200 948w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 809px) 100vw, 809px" /></figure></div><div class="padding-right-0"><div class="margin-bottom-1"><h3 class="heading-18">Mercury-Redstone 3: Freedom 7</h3></div><p class="margin-top-0 line-height-lg">NASA&#039;s first human spaceflight on May 5, 1961, Mercury-Redstone 3 was piloted by astronaut Alan Shepard.</p><div class="margin-top-2"><a href="https://www.nasa.gov/mission/mercury-redstone-3-freedom-7/" target="_self" class="button-primary button-primary-md link-external-0"><span role="textbox" aria-multiline="true" aria-label="Freedom 7 Details" class="line-height-alt-1" style="white-space: pre-wrap; min-width: 1px;">Freedom 7 Details</span><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle class="button-primary-circle" cx="16" cy="16" r="16"></circle><path d="M8 16.956h12.604l-3.844 4.106 1.252 1.338L24 16l-5.988-6.4-1.252 1.338 3.844 4.106H8v1.912z" class="color-spacesuit-white"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div><div class="hds-card-custom hds-card color-carbon-black display-flex flex-column margin-bottom-5 mobile:grid-col-12 tablet:grid-col-6 desktop:grid-col-4 margin-bottom-6"><div class="hds-card-inner"><div class="hds-card-thumbnail hds-card-hover-zoom-image margin-bottom-2 bg-carbon-black"><figure class="hds-media-background "><img decoding="async" width="1920" height="1513" src="https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s61-03698/s61-03698~large.jpg?w=1920&amp;h=1513&amp;fit=clip&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint" class="attachment-large size-large" alt="Gus Grissom next to the Liberty Bell 7 spacecraft" style="transform: scale(1.2); transform-origin: 50% 50%; object-position: 50% 50%; object-fit: cover;" block_context="nasa-block" loading="lazy" srcset="https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s61-03698/s61-03698~large.jpg?w=1920&amp;h=1513&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 1920w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s61-03698/s61-03698~large.jpg?w=300&amp;h=236&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 300w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s61-03698/s61-03698~large.jpg?w=768&amp;h=605&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 768w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s61-03698/s61-03698~large.jpg?w=1024&amp;h=807&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 1024w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s61-03698/s61-03698~large.jpg?w=1536&amp;h=1210&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 1536w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s61-03698/s61-03698~large.jpg?w=400&amp;h=315&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 400w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s61-03698/s61-03698~large.jpg?w=600&amp;h=473&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 600w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s61-03698/s61-03698~large.jpg?w=900&amp;h=709&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 900w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s61-03698/s61-03698~large.jpg?w=1200&amp;h=946&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 1200w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px" /></figure></div><div class="padding-right-0"><div class="margin-bottom-1"><h3 class="heading-18">Mercury-Redstone 4: Liberty Bell 7</h3></div><p class="margin-top-0 line-height-lg">Astronaut Virgil I. &quot;Gus&quot; Grissom was launched into space for the second U.S. crewed spaceflight on July 21, 1961.</p><div class="margin-top-2"><a href="https://www.nasa.gov/mission/mercury-redstone-4-liberty-bell-7/" target="_self" class="button-primary button-primary-md link-external-0"><span role="textbox" aria-multiline="true" aria-label="Liberty Bell 7 Details" class="line-height-alt-1" style="white-space: pre-wrap; min-width: 1px;">Liberty Bell 7 Details</span><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle class="button-primary-circle" cx="16" cy="16" r="16"></circle><path d="M8 16.956h12.604l-3.844 4.106 1.252 1.338L24 16l-5.988-6.4-1.252 1.338 3.844 4.106H8v1.912z" class="color-spacesuit-white"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div><div class="hds-card-custom hds-card color-carbon-black display-flex flex-column margin-bottom-5 mobile:grid-col-12 tablet:grid-col-6 desktop:grid-col-4 margin-bottom-6"><div class="hds-card-inner"><div class="hds-card-thumbnail hds-card-hover-zoom-image margin-bottom-2 bg-carbon-black"><figure class="hds-media-background "><img decoding="async" width="1509" height="1919" src="https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/62ma6-55/62ma6-55~large.jpg?w=1509&amp;h=1919&amp;fit=clip&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint" class="attachment-large size-large" alt="John Glenn poses in his space suit with the Friendship 7 spacecraft" style="transform: scale(1.2); transform-origin: 36% 63%; object-position: 36% 63%; object-fit: cover;" block_context="nasa-block" loading="lazy" srcset="https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/62ma6-55/62ma6-55~large.jpg?w=1509&amp;h=1919&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 1509w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/62ma6-55/62ma6-55~large.jpg?w=236&amp;h=300&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 236w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/62ma6-55/62ma6-55~large.jpg?w=768&amp;h=977&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 768w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/62ma6-55/62ma6-55~large.jpg?w=805&amp;h=1024&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 805w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/62ma6-55/62ma6-55~large.jpg?w=1208&amp;h=1536&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 1208w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/62ma6-55/62ma6-55~large.jpg?w=315&amp;h=401&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 315w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/62ma6-55/62ma6-55~large.jpg?w=472&amp;h=600&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 472w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/62ma6-55/62ma6-55~large.jpg?w=708&amp;h=900&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 708w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/62ma6-55/62ma6-55~large.jpg?w=944&amp;h=1200&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 944w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1509px) 100vw, 1509px" /></figure></div><div class="padding-right-0"><div class="margin-bottom-1"><h3 class="heading-18">Mercury-Atlas 6: Friendship 7</h3></div><p class="margin-top-0 line-height-lg">John Glenn became the first American to orbit the Earth on Feb. 20, 1962, circling the Earth three times.</p><div class="margin-top-2"><a href="https://www.nasa.gov/mission/mercury-atlas-6-friendship-7/" target="_self" class="button-primary button-primary-md link-external-0"><span role="textbox" aria-multiline="true" aria-label="Friendship 7 Details" class="line-height-alt-1" style="white-space: pre-wrap; min-width: 1px;">Friendship 7 Details</span><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle class="button-primary-circle" cx="16" cy="16" r="16"></circle><path d="M8 16.956h12.604l-3.844 4.106 1.252 1.338L24 16l-5.988-6.4-1.252 1.338 3.844 4.106H8v1.912z" class="color-spacesuit-white"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div><div class="hds-card-custom hds-card color-carbon-black display-flex flex-column margin-bottom-5 mobile:grid-col-12 tablet:grid-col-6 desktop:grid-col-4 margin-bottom-6"><div class="hds-card-inner"><div class="hds-card-thumbnail hds-card-hover-zoom-image margin-bottom-2 bg-carbon-black"><figure class="hds-media-background "><img decoding="async" width="640" height="713" src="https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/aurora_7_7_carpenter_boarding_spacecraft_may_24_1962.jpg?w=640" class="attachment-large size-large" alt="carpenter_boarding_spacecraft_may_24_1962" style="transform: scale(1.1); transform-origin: 64% 46%; object-position: 64% 46%; object-fit: cover;" block_context="nasa-block" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/aurora_7_7_carpenter_boarding_spacecraft_may_24_1962.jpg 640w, https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/aurora_7_7_carpenter_boarding_spacecraft_may_24_1962.jpg?resize=269,300 269w, https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/aurora_7_7_carpenter_boarding_spacecraft_may_24_1962.jpg?resize=359,400 359w, https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/aurora_7_7_carpenter_boarding_spacecraft_may_24_1962.jpg?resize=539,600 539w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px" /></figure></div><div class="padding-right-0"><div class="margin-bottom-1"><h3 class="heading-18">Mercury-Atlas 7: Aurora 7</h3></div><p class="margin-top-0 line-height-lg">Astronaut M. Scott Carpenter completed the fourth crewed U.S. spaceflight, circling Earth three times and performing experiments in orbit.</p><div class="margin-top-2"><a href="https://www.nasa.gov/press-release/" target="_self" class="button-primary button-primary-md link-external-0"><span role="textbox" aria-multiline="true" aria-label="Aurora 7 Details" class="line-height-alt-1" style="white-space: pre-wrap; min-width: 1px;">Aurora 7 Details</span><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle class="button-primary-circle" cx="16" cy="16" r="16"></circle><path d="M8 16.956h12.604l-3.844 4.106 1.252 1.338L24 16l-5.988-6.4-1.252 1.338 3.844 4.106H8v1.912z" class="color-spacesuit-white"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div><div class="hds-card-custom hds-card color-carbon-black display-flex flex-column margin-bottom-5 mobile:grid-col-12 tablet:grid-col-6 desktop:grid-col-4 margin-bottom-6"><div class="hds-card-inner"><div class="hds-card-thumbnail hds-card-hover-zoom-image margin-bottom-2 bg-carbon-black"><figure class="hds-media-background "><img decoding="async" width="985" height="639" src="https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/sigma_7_15_schirra_entering_spacecraft_w_cooper_7.jpg?w=985" class="attachment-large size-large" alt="Schirra entering the Sigma 7 spacecraft" style="transform: scale(1.2); transform-origin: 63% 48%; object-position: 63% 48%; object-fit: cover;" block_context="nasa-block" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/sigma_7_15_schirra_entering_spacecraft_w_cooper_7.jpg 985w, https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/sigma_7_15_schirra_entering_spacecraft_w_cooper_7.jpg?resize=300,195 300w, https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/sigma_7_15_schirra_entering_spacecraft_w_cooper_7.jpg?resize=768,498 768w, https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/sigma_7_15_schirra_entering_spacecraft_w_cooper_7.jpg?resize=400,259 400w, https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/sigma_7_15_schirra_entering_spacecraft_w_cooper_7.jpg?resize=600,389 600w, https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/sigma_7_15_schirra_entering_spacecraft_w_cooper_7.jpg?resize=900,584 900w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 985px) 100vw, 985px" /></figure></div><div class="padding-right-0"><div class="margin-bottom-1"><h3 class="heading-18">Mercury-Atlas 8: Sigma 7</h3></div><p class="margin-top-0 line-height-lg">On Oct. 3, 1962, astronaut Walter M. “Wally” Schirra completed America’s third and then-longest orbital spaceflight, completing six orbits around Earth.</p><div class="margin-top-2"><a href="https://www.nasa.gov/mission/mercury-atlas-8-sigma-7/" target="_self" class="button-primary button-primary-md link-external-0"><span role="textbox" aria-multiline="true" aria-label="Sigma 7 Details" class="line-height-alt-1" style="white-space: pre-wrap; min-width: 1px;">Sigma 7 Details</span><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle class="button-primary-circle" cx="16" cy="16" r="16"></circle><path d="M8 16.956h12.604l-3.844 4.106 1.252 1.338L24 16l-5.988-6.4-1.252 1.338 3.844 4.106H8v1.912z" class="color-spacesuit-white"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div><div class="hds-card-custom hds-card color-carbon-black display-flex flex-column margin-bottom-5 mobile:grid-col-12 tablet:grid-col-6 desktop:grid-col-4 margin-bottom-6"><div class="hds-card-inner"><div class="hds-card-thumbnail hds-card-hover-zoom-image margin-bottom-2 bg-carbon-black"><figure class="hds-media-background "><img decoding="async" width="1920" height="1234" src="https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s63-07521/s63-07521~large.jpg?w=1920&amp;h=1234&amp;fit=clip&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint" class="attachment-large size-large" alt="Gordon Cooper enters the Faith 7 spacecraft." style="transform: scale(1.1); transform-origin: 50% 50%; object-position: 50% 50%; object-fit: cover;" block_context="nasa-block" loading="lazy" srcset="https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s63-07521/s63-07521~large.jpg?w=1920&amp;h=1234&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 1920w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s63-07521/s63-07521~large.jpg?w=300&amp;h=193&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 300w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s63-07521/s63-07521~large.jpg?w=768&amp;h=494&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 768w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s63-07521/s63-07521~large.jpg?w=1024&amp;h=658&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 1024w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s63-07521/s63-07521~large.jpg?w=1536&amp;h=987&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 1536w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s63-07521/s63-07521~large.jpg?w=400&amp;h=257&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 400w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s63-07521/s63-07521~large.jpg?w=600&amp;h=386&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 600w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s63-07521/s63-07521~large.jpg?w=900&amp;h=578&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 900w, https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s63-07521/s63-07521~large.jpg?w=1200&amp;h=771&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cfocalpoint 1200w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px" /></figure></div><div class="padding-right-0"><div class="margin-bottom-1"><h3 class="heading-18">Mercury-Atlas 9: Faith 7</h3></div><p class="margin-top-0 line-height-lg">For the final crewed mission of Project Mercury in May 1963, astronaut L. Gordon Cooper completed 22 orbits around the Earth.</p><div class="margin-top-2"><a href="https://www.nasa.gov/mission/mercury-atlas-9-faith-7/" target="_self" class="button-primary button-primary-md link-external-0"><span role="textbox" aria-multiline="true" aria-label="Faith 7 Details" class="line-height-alt-1" style="white-space: pre-wrap; min-width: 1px;">Faith 7 Details</span><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle class="button-primary-circle" cx="16" cy="16" r="16"></circle><path d="M8 16.956h12.604l-3.844 4.106 1.252 1.338L24 16l-5.988-6.4-1.252 1.338 3.844 4.106H8v1.912z" class="color-spacesuit-white"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div>				</div>
			</div>
	</div>

