								<h2 class="heading-36 margin-0">Crewed Flights Summary</h2>
							</div>
							<div class="grid-col-12 desktop:grid-col-6">
								<p class="p-md margin-0 color-carbon-black">Mercury, America&#039;s first human space flight program, introduced the nation to its first astronauts. There were six total flights with six astronauts flown. Total flight time for these missions was 53 hours, 55 minutes and 27 seconds.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
